{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"马尔代夫","country_iso":"MDV","created_at":"2026-04-10T08:36:25.077097","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MDV-HB-0010","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马尔代夫12个岛光柴储微电网项目","project_name_en":"Maldives 12 Islands Solar-Diesel-Storage Microgrid Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中腾微网","content":"2021年08月26日，中腾微网（北京）科技有限公司成功中标马尔代夫12个岛光柴储微电网总承包项目。\n此项目是中腾微网在马尔代夫地区自26岛微电网项目之后的第二个微电网项目，中腾微网在与众多国内外竞争对手的角逐中最终成功中标！\n项目概况\n亚洲开发银行和马尔代夫政府共同投建的外岛可持续能源发展项目（POISED），计划安装能源管理和控制系统，储能，改进现有输配电网络，以显著减少当地对柴油的依赖，将群岛现有的电网转变为混合可再生能源系统。\nMaldives\n可持续能源发展项目\nPOISED项目计划在当地的众多居民岛屿上安装太阳能及柴油发电混合电网设备，将利用可再生能源和柴油机的智慧能源管理系统取代岛上效率低下的柴油发电网络，以降低电力成本和产生的有害气体排放，并减轻政府对电力系统建设的补贴负担。","content_sha256":"e6cb3dc64596c6dee57378cfb508e7e32a6e9ac5b69f68fa77a94c87ff74d9dd","id":18196,"publish_date":"2021-08-30 18:20:43","title":"中腾微网成功中标马尔代夫12个岛光柴储微电网项目","title_sha256":"f3bda7e8fb47d9487867e2aab845968e0ba4720a4d9186f4238a478c8edcf4a3","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/22173.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MDV-HB-0010","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T08:36:25.081359","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MDV-HB-0010-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.sinosoarhybrid.com/zh/12-islands-mini-grid-project-in-maldives/\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"亚洲开发银行;马尔代夫政府","project_developer_en":"Asian Development Bank; Government of Maldives","project_